  "code" : "public int findLargestMinDistance(int[] boards, int painters) {\n    int low = max(boards), high = sum(boards), ans = high;\n    while (low <= high) {\n        int mid = (low + high) / 2;\n        if (paintersNeeded(boards, mid) <= painters) {\n            ans = mid;\n            high = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            low = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    return ans;\n}\n\nprivate int paintersNeeded(int[] boards, int cap) {\n    int painters = 1, time = 0;\n    for (int b : boards) {\n        if (time + b > cap) {\n            painters++;\n            time = b;\n        } else {\n            time += b;\n        }\n    }\n    return painters;\n}",
